        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kwakali inkondo mujulu. Mikayeli abaangelo bakwe bakalwanisya Simwaaba, alakwe Simwaaba wakalwa, abaangelo bakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
