        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo ndakaswiilila ijwi ipati mujulu, lyakati, Sunu kwasika lufutuko, anguzu, abwami bwa-Leza wesu, abwami bwa-Kristo wakwe, nkaambo sikubejelezya bakwesu twaambo wawisigwa ansi, nguwe wakali kubabejelezya kuli-Leza wesu lyoonse isikati amasiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
