        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakamuzunda kubulowa bwa-Mwanambelele akujwi lyabumboni bwabo, nkabela buumi bwabo teebakali kubuyandisya pe, bakazumina nikuba kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
